clear
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p m
atom_modify sort 0 0
read_data ../fire_fixedbase_100/minimized.data
mass 1 47.867
mass 2 28.0855
mass 3 12.011
mass 4 107.8682
pair_style hybrid/overlay eam tersoff morse 8.0 zbl 1.5 2.4
pair_coeff 4 4 eam ../../../../../../models/ag_ti3sic2_qsgs_1to1_finer/potentials/Ag_u3.eam
pair_coeff * * tersoff ../../../../../../models/ag_ti3sic2_qsgs_1to1_finer/potentials/TSCBOP.tersoff Ti Si C NULL
pair_coeff 4 1 morse 0.678644 1.155035 2.989514 8.0
pair_coeff 4 2 morse 0.020000 3.107766 1.400605 8.0
pair_coeff 4 3 morse 0.020000 7.804451 1.400000 8.0
pair_coeff 4 1 zbl 47 22
pair_coeff 4 2 zbl 47 14
pair_coeff 4 3 zbl 47 6
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
region rbase block INF INF INF INF 0.0 20.0 units box
region rbath block INF INF INF INF 20.0 40.0 units box
region rnewt block INF INF INF INF 40.0 200.0 units box
group base region rbase
group mobile subtract all base
group bathgeom region rbath
group bath intersect mobile bathgeom
group newtgeom region rnewt
group newton intersect mobile newtgeom
fix hold base setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
velocity base set 0.0 0.0 0.0
velocity mobile create 300.0 52217 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
compute tmobile mobile temp
compute tbath bath temp
compute tnewton newton temp
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute fmax all reduce max v_fmag
fix bathfix bath nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
fix_modify bathfix temp tbath
fix int newton nve
timestep 0.001
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_tmobile c_tbath c_tnewton pe ke etotal press fmax
thermo_modify temp tmobile lost error flush yes
run 100
write_dump all custom final.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id
write_data final.data
